    vehicleAccessEnabled/Disabled/Unknown, vehicleAccessAuthorized, vehicleAccessNoDrivers,
    vehicleAccessPending, vehicleAccessNoInvitations, vehicleAccessOwner/Driver,
    vehicleAccessPendingStatus/Accepted/Expired, vehicleAccessNoData -> ALL PRESENT in
